                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When the display cannot hold 360 + 8 + 600 px, the companion does not open as a second window. The timelines take over the main panel instead, with an Accounts control returning to the account list. This is a degraded mode: the narrow rows carry the quota percentage only, so the row detail holds the exact window start, end and countdown. Everything else — the shared axis, the full-window bars, the account order, the Now line, the states — is identical to the wide layout.",
